<title>NEW ZEALAND: Tamrof declares holding in McCollan.</title>
<headline>Tamrof declares holding in McCollan.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tamrof Investments Ltd declared on Tuesday that in February it became a substantial security holder in McCollan Printers with an 11.25 percent stake.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
